---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CommandInterface from '../components/CommandInterface.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About · MAY'D IT">
  <section class="page-intro shell prose-page">
    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT</span>
    <h1>Build the system. Understand the system.</h1>
    <p>I work across systems architecture, infrastructure, security, automation, and software, with a bias toward designs that are understandable under pressure.</p>
    <p>MAY'D IT follows the same rule: static where possible, dynamic only where justified, and experimental surfaces isolated from trusted ones.</p>
  </section>
  <CommandInterface slot="after-body" />
</BaseLayout>
